SANDBOX payment simulator, not a live charge. 4242424242424242 succeeds (Visa). 4000000000000002 declines. The full card number is never stored or returned; only brand and last4. Set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY to send the same call to Stripe test mode instead. A successful sandbox charge creates the invoice and attempts the confirmation email.

Input JSON schema:
{"type": "object", "required": ["action", "order_id", "card_number"], "properties": {"action": {"const": "pay"}, "order_id": {"type": "string"}

